# Logs
# Anchored + dir-only: a bare `logs` also matched the `src/app/logs` route
# and silently un-tracked the whole logs page. Keep this to a top-level
# build/output logs dir; `*.log` below still covers stray log files.
/logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

node_modules
dist
dist-ssr
*.local

# Editor directories and files
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?
